      "opacity": 100,
      "originalText": "Learning loop only becomes meaningful once conversion signal accumulates (typically 30-50 conversions per ad set for Meta,\n30 per month for Google). Meta & Google also model conversions for privacy-limited browsers (no third-party cookie).",
      "roughness": 1,
      "roundness": null,
